      "title": "Application Tier (Express & MongoDB)",
      "items": [
        "Strict IDOR security checks ensuring users only access their own records",
        "Ephemeral Multer memory storage parses resume text with zero disk persistence",
        "Mongoose models persist Users, Applications, Resumes, and MatchResults"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "AI Match Tier (Google Gemini)",
      "items": [
        "SHA-256 hash (resume::JD) caches evaluations to avoid duplicate API calls",
        "Strict rate-limiting enforces a 10 matches/day per-user quota",
